#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_ESPERANTA_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_ESPERANTA_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.1.1"
msgid ""
msgstr "-Costs 40 health and 40 sanity\n-You and nearby allies gain:\n   A shield that blocks one hit\n   2 health restored per second for 20 seconds"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_ESPERANTA_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_ESPERANTA_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2"
msgid ""
msgstr "-Costs 200 sanity\n-The Special Treatment Gun fires special ammunition. On hit:\n   Deals %d true damage in the area\n   Restores %d health to nearby allies\n   Destroys nearby chop- and mine-able objects\n   Staggers enemies for 5 seconds (movement speed reduced by 80%%)\n-Requires the Special Treatment Gun and Life Repairing Units"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_ESPERANTA_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2_PERCENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_ESPERANTA_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2_PERCENT"
msgid ""
msgstr "-Costs 200 sanity\n-The Special Treatment Gun fires special ammunition. On hit:\n   Deals %d base true damage plus true damage equal to %d%% of the target's maximum health in the area\n   Restores %d health to nearby allies\n   Destroys nearby chop- and mine-able objects\n   Staggers enemies for 5 seconds (movement speed reduced by 80%%)\n-Requires the Special Treatment Gun and Life Repairing Units"

